{"seq":2,"slug":"hnsw-params","title":"HNSW 参数（m/ef_construction）与召回","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/elasticsearch-vector-hybrid-search/vector-index/hnsw-params","wordCount":2908,"readingTime":12,"html":"<h1 id=\"hnsw-参数-m-ef_construction-与召回\">HNSW 参数（m/ef_construction）与召回</h1><p>HNSW 是分层可导航小世界图，它的召回率不是一个可以随便调的旋钮，而是由图结构的连通性决定的。调参时最容易被忽略的事实是：<code>m</code> 和 <code>ef_construction</code> 在建索引时就固定了图，而查询时的 <code>num_candidates</code> 只是在已建好的图上走得更远一些。如果图本身没连对，查询期再怎么加大候选数也找不回那些根本没连进图的相关文档。这一篇把三个参数的分工、它们各自能影响的召回上限、以及为什么&quot;把 <code>m</code> 调大&quot;有时反而更差讲清楚。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>HNSW 把全部向量组织成一张分层导航图：上层稀疏、跨度大，用于快速逼近目标区域；下层稠密、跨度小，用于在局部精细搜索。检索时从最上层的一个入口点出发，在每一层做贪心游走，找到该层里离查询最近的节点后下沉到下一层继续，直到最底层输出结果。这套结构的全部可调行为只有三个参数，它们分别对应&quot;图的形状&quot;、&quot;图怎么建&quot;、&quot;每次走多远&quot;。</p>\n<p>三个参数构成一条清晰的责任链：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>recall</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>f</mi><mtext>graph</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>m</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>ef_construction</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>g</mi><mtext>search</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>num_candidates</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P(\\text{recall}) = f_{\\text{graph}}(m, \\text{ef\\_construction}) \\cdot g_{\\text{search}}(\\text{num\\_candidates})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">recall</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.06em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">graph</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">ef_construction</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.06em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">search</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">num_candidates</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这个分解式表达的是：图的质量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span></span> 给出召回率上限，查询期的搜索深度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>g</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">g</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span></span> 决定你在这次查询里用到上限的多少比例。两者相乘，因此任一项接近零时整体都接近零——这是&quot;只调 <code>num_candidates</code> 无效&quot;和&quot;只把 <code>m</code> 加到很大也无效&quot;这两个现象的同一个解释。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>参数</th>\n<th>生效阶段</th>\n<th>默认值</th>\n<th>影响的资源</th>\n<th>调整代价</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>m</code></td>\n<td>索引构建</td>\n<td>16</td>\n<td>图内存（近似正比）、构建时间</td>\n<td>重建索引</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>ef_construction</code></td>\n<td>索引构建</td>\n<td>100</td>\n<td>构建时间、图的连通质量</td>\n<td>重建索引</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>num_candidates</code></td>\n<td>每次查询</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1.5</mn><mo>×</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1.5 \\times k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.5</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>查询延迟、召回</td>\n<td>请求内即时生效</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>（<code>m</code> 默认 16、<code>ef_construction</code> 默认 100 来源：Elasticsearch dense_vector 映射参考, <a href=\"https://www.elastic.co/docs/reference/elasticsearch/mapping-reference/dense-vector；`num_candidates`\">https://www.elastic.co/docs/reference/elasticsearch/mapping-reference/dense-vector；`num_candidates`</a> 默认 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1.5</mn><mo>×</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1.5 \\times k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.5</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 来源：Elasticsearch kNN 查询参考, <a href=\"https://www.elastic.co/guide/en/elasticsearch/reference/current/query-dsl-knn-query.html）\">https://www.elastic.co/guide/en/elasticsearch/reference/current/query-dsl-knn-query.html）</a></p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  E[&quot;入口点 (顶层)&quot;] --&gt; L1[&quot;贪心游走在稀疏层&quot;]&#10;  L1 --&gt; L2[&quot;下沉到更密的层&quot;]&#10;  L2 --&gt; L3[&quot;最底层: 候选队列长度 = num_candidates&quot;]&#10;  L3 --&gt; R[&quot;截取每分片 top-k&quot;]&#10;  R --&gt; M[&quot;协调节点归并全局 top-k&quot;]&#10;  M --&gt; O[&quot;结果&quot;]\">graph TD\n  E[\"入口点 (顶层)\"] --&gt; L1[\"贪心游走在稀疏层\"]\n  L1 --&gt; L2[\"下沉到更密的层\"]\n  L2 --&gt; L3[\"最底层: 候选队列长度 = num_candidates\"]\n  L3 --&gt; R[\"截取每分片 top-k\"]\n  R --&gt; M[\"协调节点归并全局 top-k\"]\n  M --&gt; O[\"结果\"]</pre><p>图中&quot;候选队列长度 = <code>num_candidates</code>&quot;是唯一可以在运行时改变的一环，其余环节在索引建成后固定。这也解释了为什么调优的正确起点是查询期扫描而不是重建索引。</p>\n<h2 id=\"图结构的三个参数各管什么\">图结构的三个参数各管什么</h2><p>Elasticsearch 里这三个参数位在不同的位置：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"PUT /documents&#10;{&#10;  &quot;mappings&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;properties&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;vec&quot;: {&#10;        &quot;type&quot;: &quot;dense_vector&quot;,&#10;        &quot;dims&quot;: 768,&#10;        &quot;index_options&quot;: {&#10;          &quot;type&quot;: &quot;hnsw&quot;,&#10;          &quot;m&quot;: 16,&#10;          &quot;ef_construction&quot;: 100&#10;        }&#10;      }&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">PUT /documents</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"mappings\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"properties\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"vec\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"type\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"dense_vector\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"dims\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">768</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"index_options\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">          \"type\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"hnsw\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">          \"m\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">16</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">          \"ef_construction\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">100</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>查询期参数在请求里：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"POST /documents/_search&#10;{&#10;  &quot;knn&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;field&quot;: &quot;vec&quot;,&#10;    &quot;query_vector&quot;: [0.1, 0.2],&#10;    &quot;k&quot;: 10,&#10;    &quot;num_candidates&quot;: 200&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">POST /documents/_search</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"knn\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"field\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"vec\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"query_vector\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"k\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"num_candidates\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">200</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>查询形态上有一点必须分清：ES 提供顶层 <code>knn</code> 与查询 DSL 里的 <code>knn</code> 查询两种写法，前者只支持已建索引的 <code>dense_vector</code> 字段且不能与 <code>query</code> 并列，后者可以嵌在 <code>bool</code>、<code>nested</code> 里并支持 <code>semantic_text</code> 字段。两者在聚合上的行为也不同：顶层写法的聚合基于全局 top <code>k</code>，而 <code>knn</code> 查询的聚合基于每个分片的 top <code>k</code>（实际覆盖 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>×</mo><mtext>分片数</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k \\times \\text{分片数}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">分片数</span></span></span></span></span></span> 条）。参数语义则完全一致。（来源：Elasticsearch kNN 查询参考, <a href=\"https://www.elastic.co/guide/en/elasticsearch/reference/current/query-dsl-knn-query.html）这两种写法的完整选择依据在\">https://www.elastic.co/guide/en/elasticsearch/reference/current/query-dsl-knn-query.html）这两种写法的完整选择依据在</a> <a href=\"../hybrid-fusion/knn-bm25-combine\">KNN 与 BM25 并行召回</a> 里展开。</p>\n<p>三者的分工是：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>参数</th>\n<th>何时生效</th>\n<th>默认值</th>\n<th>影响</th>\n<th>可否事后改</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>m</code></td>\n<td>建索引时</td>\n<td>16</td>\n<td>每个节点保留的双向连接数；决定图的连通度与内存</td>\n<td>只能保持或增大，实际做法是重建</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>ef_construction</code></td>\n<td>建索引时</td>\n<td>100</td>\n<td>插入每个节点时追踪的候选队列长度；决定图的构建质量</td>\n<td>需重建</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>num_candidates</code></td>\n<td>查询时</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1.5</mn><mo>×</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1.5 \\times k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.5</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span>（<code>k</code> 省略时为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1.5</mn><mo>×</mo><mtext>size</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1.5 \\times \\text{size}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.5</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6679em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">size</span></span></span></span></span></span>）</td>\n<td>每个分片上考虑的候选池大小</td>\n<td>每次查询都可改，上限 10000</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>（<code>num_candidates</code> &quot;Defaults to 1.5 _ k if k is set, or 1.5 _ size if k is not set&quot; 与 &quot;Cannot exceed 10,000&quot; 来源：Elasticsearch kNN 查询参考, <a href=\"https://www.elastic.co/guide/en/elasticsearch/reference/current/query-dsl-knn-query.html）\">https://www.elastic.co/guide/en/elasticsearch/reference/current/query-dsl-knn-query.html）</a></p>\n<p>把这个分工翻译成一句话：<code>m</code> 和 <code>ef_construction</code> 决定图的&quot;质量上限&quot;，<code>num_candidates</code> 决定你&quot;在这次查询里把上限用到多深&quot;。很多团队报告&quot;调大 <code>num_candidates</code> 没有提升召回&quot;，原因通常不是这个参数无效，而是图在上限处已经封顶——还有一小部分文档根本没有从查询入口可达的路径。</p>\n<h2 id=\"m-与-ef_construction-的取舍曲线\">m 与 ef_construction 的取舍曲线</h2><p><code>m</code> 增加时，每个节点连接到更多邻居，图的平均跳数下降，遍历时更不容易掉进局部最优。代价是双向的：图的内存近似正比于 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span></span></span></span></span>，建索引时间也正比于 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span></span></span></span></span>（因为每次插入要维护更多连接）。经验上，从 16 提到 32 通常带来可测的召回提升，从 32 提到 64 的边际收益迅速下降，而内存与构建时间继续线性增长。</p>\n<p><code>ef_construction</code> 增加时，插入一个节点时会从更大的候选队列里挑选邻居，因此更可能选到&quot;真正近的&quot;邻居而不是&quot;当时手边最近的&quot;。这个参数的收益曲线比 <code>m</code> 更陡：从默认 100 提到 200 到 400 在多数数据集上都能看到召回单调提升，且它对内存没有影响——只增加建索引时间。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"PUT /documents/_settings&#10;{&#10;  &quot;index&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;mapping&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;total_fields&quot;: {&#10;        &quot;limit&quot;: 2000&#10;      }&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">PUT /documents/_settings</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"index\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"mapping\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"total_fields\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"limit\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2000</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>上面这条请求和 HNSW 无关，列在这里是为了做一个提示：在 ES 里调整 HNSW 参数不是通过 <code>_settings</code>，而是必须新建索引并重新写入。这也意味着&quot;线上调参&quot;的真实成本是一次 reindex，因此每次参数实验都应记录在案，避免重复劳动。</p>\n<p>一个常被问到的问题：能不能只调 <code>ef_construction</code> 而不动 <code>m</code>？可以，而且这通常是更划算的第一步——它对内存零成本，能提升图质量，只是需要重跑一次 reindex。两步走的顺序建议是：先只把 <code>ef_construction</code> 从 100 提到 256，测量召回变化；如果提升仍然不够，再把 <code>m</code> 从 16 提到 32 并重建。</p>\n<h2 id=\"查询期候选数与召回延迟曲线\">查询期候选数与召回延迟曲线</h2><p><code>num_candidates</code> 是唯一可以在每次请求里改的参数，因此它是调优的第一站，也是弹性应对流量压力的手段。它的行为要点：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>每个分片会独立地取出 <code>num_candidates</code> 个候选，再各自归并出 <code>k</code> 条，最后由协调节点合并。因此全局实际考虑的候选数是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>num_candidates</mtext><mo>×</mo><mtext>shard count</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{num\\_candidates} \\times \\text{shard count}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0044em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">num_candidates</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">shard count</span></span></span></span></span></span>（近似，分片间有重叠）。</li>\n<li><code>num_candidates</code> 不能超过 10000。需要更大候选池时，正确的做法通常是减小分片数或降低维数，而不是继续加大。</li>\n<li>与 <code>k</code> 的关系：<code>k</code> 是从每个分片返回的最近邻数量，<code>num_candidates</code> 必须不小于 <code>k</code>。文档给出的默认值是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1.5</mn><mo>×</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1.5 \\times k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.5</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span>，在需要高召回时这个默认值明显偏小，提升到 10 倍到 20 倍的 <code>k</code> 是常见做法。</li>\n<li>启用量化重打分（<code>rescore_vector</code>）时，候选数会被自动抬高到至少 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>×</mo><mtext>oversample</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k \\times \\text{oversample}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">oversample</span></span></span></span></span></span>，见 <a href=\"bbq-scalar-quant\">BBQ/标量量化与内存-精度取舍</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>把召回率对 <code>num_candidates</code> 画出来，形状几乎总是这样：在低候选区近似线性上升，到某个拐点后转入平台，平台高度由 <code>m</code> 与 <code>ef_construction</code> 决定。调参的目标不是追求平台的最大值，而是找到&quot;边际召回收益低于边际延迟成本&quot;的那个点。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  S[召回不达标] --&gt; A{是否已有对照基线?}&#10;  A --&gt;|否| B[先测 num_candidates 扫描: k*5, k*10, k*20]&#10;  A --&gt;|是| C{扫描后召回是否到平台?}&#10;  B --&gt; C&#10;  C --&gt;|仍随候选数上升| D[图质量不足: 提高 ef_construction 后 reindex]&#10;  C --&gt;|已到平台但绝对值低| E{过滤条件是否很强?}&#10;  E --&gt;|是| F[问题在过滤而非 HNSW: 见过滤 ANN 一篇]&#10;  E --&gt;|否| G[提高 m 到 32 后 reindex]&#10;  D --&gt; H[重测, 确认拐点是否右移]&#10;  G --&gt; H\">graph TD\n  S[召回不达标] --&gt; A{是否已有对照基线?}\n  A --&gt;|否| B[先测 num_candidates 扫描: k*5, k*10, k*20]\n  A --&gt;|是| C{扫描后召回是否到平台?}\n  B --&gt; C\n  C --&gt;|仍随候选数上升| D[图质量不足: 提高 ef_construction 后 reindex]\n  C --&gt;|已到平台但绝对值低| E{过滤条件是否很强?}\n  E --&gt;|是| F[问题在过滤而非 HNSW: 见过滤 ANN 一篇]\n  E --&gt;|否| G[提高 m 到 32 后 reindex]\n  D --&gt; H[重测, 确认拐点是否右移]\n  G --&gt; H</pre><p>这张图的判断链条里有一个重要出口：如果召回在候选数扫描中很快进入平台且绝对值长期偏低，而查询本身带了高选择性过滤条件，那么瓶颈很可能不在 HNSW 参数，而在过滤与 ANN 的交互方式——那条路径见 <a href=\"../rerank-filter/filtered-ann\">过滤 ANN：先过滤 vs 后过滤</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"图索引的内存与构建代价实测口径\">图索引的内存与构建代价实测口径</h2><p>参数实验要可复现，就必须固定测量口径。建议至少记录四项：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>采集方式</th>\n<th>为什么重要</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>召回率 @ k</td>\n<td>用一个判断列表（judgment list）离线计算</td>\n<td>唯一能判断参数是否有效的依据</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>单次查询延迟 P50/P99</td>\n<td><code>took</code> 字段或客户端埋点</td>\n<td>区分平均收益与被长尾拖累</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>索引构建耗时</td>\n<td><code>_cat/indices</code> 结合 reindex 墙钟时间</td>\n<td><code>ef_construction</code> 的代价主要体现在这里</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>向量段内存占用</td>\n<td><code>_nodes/stats</code> 的 segment 内存</td>\n<td><code>m</code> 的代价主要体现在这里</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>第 1 项的&quot;判断列表&quot;是前提：没有标注数据时，任何参数对比都只是感觉。构建最小判断列表的方法在 <a href=\"../integration-eval/recall-latency-eval\">召回率-延迟评估与 A/B</a> 里给出。</p>\n<p>关于 <code>m</code> 的一个反直觉现象：把 <code>m</code> 调得很大（例如 128）在某些数据集上会轻微降低召回。原因是连接数过多时，图在构建期为了控制度数会对候选邻居做剪枝，剪枝策略在高 <code>m</code> 下可能砍掉长距离连接，而这类连接恰恰是跨簇跳转的桥梁。因此 <code>m</code> 不是越大越好，超过 64 之后必须靠实测判断。</p>\n<p>另一个与分片相关的效应：HNSW 是每段（per-segment）构建的。一个分片内的多个 segment 各自持有一份图，查询时要遍历所有段。这意味着文档分批写入、段数量多的时候，每个段内的图规模小、图质量相对差，且总遍历开销上升。合并段（force merge）可以改善这一点，但会带来 IO 压力，是否值得做以及什么时候做，属于集群运维决策而非参数调优决策。</p>\n<h2 id=\"与-opensearch-参数名对照\">与 OpenSearch 参数名对照</h2><p>两条栈在参数语义上一致，但命名和生效位置不同，迁移时容易错位：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>Elasticsearch</th>\n<th>OpenSearch</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>每节点连接数</td>\n<td><code>index_options.m</code></td>\n<td><code>method.parameters.m</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>构建期候选队列</td>\n<td><code>index_options.ef_construction</code></td>\n<td><code>method.parameters.ef_construction</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>查询期候选深度</td>\n<td>每次查询的 <code>num_candidates</code></td>\n<td>索引级 <code>index.knn.algo_param.ef_search</code>，或查询级 <code>method_parameters.ef_search</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>图算法与引擎</td>\n<td>由 <code>index_options.type</code> 决定</td>\n<td>由 <code>method.name</code>（<code>hnsw</code>/<code>ivf</code>）+ <code>method.engine</code>（<code>lucene</code>/<code>faiss</code>/<code>nmslib</code>）共同决定</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>差别的实际影响在于：ES 把查询期深度放在请求里，便于按查询动态放宽；OpenSearch 传统上把它放在索引设置 <code>index.knn.algo_param.ef_search</code> 里作为全局默认（该设置默认值为 100），可以在查询里用 <code>method_parameters</code> 覆盖。如果你从 ES 迁移到 OpenSearch 并沿用&quot;每次请求调候选数&quot;的做法，需要显式在查询子句里传 <code>ef_search</code>，否则会一直用索引默认值。（来源：OpenSearch 向量搜索设置, <a href=\"https://docs.opensearch.org/latest/vector-search/settings/\">https://docs.opensearch.org/latest/vector-search/settings/</a> 与 OpenSearch k-NN 查询, <a href=\"https://docs.opensearch.org/latest/query-dsl/specialized/k-nn/）\">https://docs.opensearch.org/latest/query-dsl/specialized/k-nn/）</a></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"PUT /hotels-index&#10;{&#10;  &quot;settings&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;index&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;knn&quot;: true,&#10;      &quot;knn.algo_param.ef_search&quot;: 100&#10;    }&#10;  },&#10;  &quot;mappings&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;properties&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;location&quot;: {&#10;        &quot;type&quot;: &quot;knn_vector&quot;,&#10;        &quot;dimension&quot;: 2,&#10;        &quot;method&quot;: {&#10;          &quot;name&quot;: &quot;hnsw&quot;,&#10;          &quot;space_type&quot;: &quot;l2&quot;,&#10;          &quot;engine&quot;: &quot;lucene&quot;,&#10;          &quot;parameters&quot;: { &quot;ef_construction&quot;: 100, &quot;m&quot;: 16 }&#10;        }&#10;      }&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">PUT /hotels-index</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"settings\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"index\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"knn\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"knn.algo_param.ef_search\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">100</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"mappings\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"properties\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"location\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"type\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"knn_vector\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"dimension\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"method\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">          \"name\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"hnsw\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">          \"space_type\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"l2\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">          \"engine\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"lucene\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">          \"parameters\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"ef_construction\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">100</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"m\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">16</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>注意 OpenSearch 的 <code>method.parameters</code> 里没有查询期参数，<code>ef_search</code> 属于索引设置或查询子句，这是与 ES 最容易混淆的一处。字段类型本身的差异（<code>knn_vector</code> 的 <code>dimension</code>、<code>space_type</code>、<code>engine</code>）在 <a href=\"../integration-eval/opensearch-neural\">OpenSearch neural search 与模型插件</a> 里有完整对照。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><code>m</code> 与 <code>ef_construction</code> 在主建的索引期固定图的质量上限，<code>num_candidates</code>（或 OpenSearch 的 <code>ef_search</code>）只在查询期决定用多深。</li>\n<li>先扫描 <code>num_candidates</code>，看召回是否进入平台；进入平台说明图质量是瓶颈，才值得付出 reindex 代价调 <code>m</code> 或 <code>ef_construction</code>。</li>\n<li>调优顺序推荐：<code>ef_construction</code> 100 → 256（内存零成本，只增加构建时间），再考虑 <code>m</code> 16 → 32。</li>\n<li><code>m</code> 超过约 64 后收益递减甚至可能因剪枝而轻微降低召回，必须用判断列表实测而不是凭直觉加大。</li>\n<li>每个段各自建图，段多会同时拉低召回与抬高延迟；这也是分片与合并策略影响相关性的原因。</li>\n<li>参数实验必须同时记录召回、延迟、构建耗时、段内存四项，否则结论无法复现。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>选好图参数之后，如果内存仍然超出预算，下一步是量化——它能在不改变图结构的前提下把每维字节数降下来，见 <a href=\"bbq-scalar-quant\">BBQ/标量量化与内存-精度取舍</a>；如果索引已经建好但召回在候选数扫描中快速封顶且查询带强过滤，先看 <a href=\"../rerank-filter/filtered-ann\">过滤 ANN：先过滤 vs 后过滤</a> 再决定是否重建索引。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"HNSW 参数（m/ef_construction）与召回","id":"hnsw-参数-m-ef_construction-与召回"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"图结构的三个参数各管什么","id":"图结构的三个参数各管什么"},{"level":2,"text":"m 与 ef_construction 的取舍曲线","id":"m-与-ef_construction-的取舍曲线"},{"level":2,"text":"查询期候选数与召回延迟曲线","id":"查询期候选数与召回延迟曲线"},{"level":2,"text":"图索引的内存与构建代价实测口径","id":"图索引的内存与构建代价实测口径"},{"level":2,"text":"与 OpenSearch 参数名对照","id":"与-opensearch-参数名对照"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"dense_vector 映射与维度/量化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/elasticsearch-vector-hybrid-search/vector-index/dense-vector-mapping"},"next":{"title":"BBQ/标量量化与内存-精度取舍","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/elasticsearch-vector-hybrid-search/vector-index/bbq-scalar-quant"}}